enchmarks\n- Source quality assessment\n\n### 6. **COMPLETION_SUMMARY.md** (14KB)\nJob completion report documenting:\n- All objectives achieved\n- Research methodology\n- Quality metrics\n- Deliverable inventory\n\n## 🎯 Key Research Findings\n\n**State-of-the-Art Performance (2026):**\n- **Clean Speech**: 2.8% WER (Whisper-Large-v3)\n- **Noisy Conditions**: 12-18% WER (significant challenge remains)\n- **Speed**: 150 RTFx (Parakeet-TDT) for real-time applications\n- **Languages**: 99+ supported (Whisper)\n- **Low-Resource**: Works with just 10 minutes labeled data (wav2vec2)\n\n**Leading Systems Analyzed:**\n1. **Whisper** (OpenAI) - Best for multilingual, high accuracy\n2. **wav2vec2** (Meta) - Best for low-resource languages\n3. **Parakeet-TDT** (NVIDIA) - Best for real-time streaming\n4. **Kaldi** - Best for custom domains with maximum control\n5. **Vosk** - Best for lightweight edge deployment\n\n**Major Challenges Identified:**\n- 5-10x WER degradation in real-world noisy conditions\n- 2-4x WER disparity across accents and dialects\n- Hallucination issues in LLM-based ASR systems\n- High computational costs for large models\n- Privacy concerns with cloud-based deployment\n\n## 📊 Research Scope\n\n- **Academic Papers Reviewed**: 30+\n- **Systems Analyzed**: 8 major frameworks\n- **Benchmarks Evaluated**: Open ASR Leaderboard (60+ systems), MLPerf\n- **Code Examples**: 20+ working implementations\n- **Total Sources**: 58 documented and cited\n- **Use Cases**: 8 detailed application scenarios\n\nAll research materials have been saved to the repository and are ready for review. The documents are structured for multiple audiences - from quick executive summaries to deep technical analysis, with practical implementation guides for developers."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","usage":{"input":13,"output":932,"cacheRead":101374,"cacheWrite":571,"totalTokens":102890,"cost":{"input":0.000039,"output":0.01398000000